## Summary
Colleges are reshaping STEM education to improve student success through redesigning introductory courses, expanding hands-on learning experiences, and creating new career pathways.

## Key Points
- Redesigning gateway courses to enhance introductory STEM education
- Expanding practical, hands-on learning opportunities for students
- Developing new career paths within STEM disciplines
- Focusing on increasing student success and retention in STEM fields


